    title: "a CLOCK read is catalogued host_info_read and mints host_description: currentTimeMillis/nanoTime are 408 of cassandra's 459 recovered java.lang edges and 5 of jenkins' 20 new situations, all false positives"  # 30a7
    status: todo_hard  # 30a7
    priority: 3  # 30a7
